# Vulnerabilities in pip's own vendored dependencies (usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pip/_vendor/).
# These are bundled inside pip itself for bootstrap reasons; upgrading msgpack/setuptools/urllib3 in
# requirements.txt does not touch pip's private vendored copies. They are used only during pip's
# operations (parsing PyPI responses, installing packages), never by the running application, so they
# are not exploitable at runtime. Revisit after pip publishes a release with newer vendored versions.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
CVE-2025-47273
CVE-2026-97687
CVE-2026-97689
